    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60032" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίσῐμος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐς], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίσις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>decisive,
				critical</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἡμέρα</span> the
				<i>crisis</i> of a disease, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.85
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				230b5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γὰρ αὕτη γίγνεται</span>
			(sc. the seventh day) <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				890
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. φάεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.382.11
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν κρισίμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μως</span> Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>l.c.</div>
